  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nX1 is 11% more than X2\n\nX1 is 67% less than X3\n\nValue of X2 = Rs. 1331\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\nX1 = X2 + 11% of X2\n\nX1 = X3 - 67% of X3\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nX1 = 1331 + (11/100) × 1331\n\nX1 = 1331 + 146.41\n\nX1 = 1477.41\n\nX1 = X3 - (67/100) × X3\n\nX1 = X3 × (1 - 0.67)\n\nX1 = X3 × 0.33\n\n⇒ 1477.41 = X3 × 0.33\n\n⇒ X3 = 1477.41 / 0.33\n\n⇒ X3 = 4477\n\n**The value of X3 is Rs. 4477.**",
